{"id":"mtk-02d-pecahan-campuran-campur","type":"subbab","subject":"mtk","chapter":"mtk-02","subBab":"mtk-02d","slug":"pecahan-campuran","tier":"campur","title":"OSN SD · MTK · Sub-bab MTK-02d · Pecahan Campuran","theory":[{"title":"A. Apa itu Pecahan Campuran?","content":"**Pecahan campuran** adalah penjumlahan **bilangan bulat positif** dengan **pecahan biasa murni** (pembilang < penyebut).\nDitulis dengan format **a b/c**, dibaca \"a dan b per c\", artinya `a + b/c`.\n\nContoh:\n- 2¾ = 2 + ¾ → dua kue utuh + tiga perempat kue.\n- 5½ = 5 + ½ → lima setengah jam.\n- 1⅖ = 1 + ⅖ → satu kilogram lebih dua per lima kilogram.\n\n**Syarat pecahan campuran sah:**\n1. Bagian bulat `a` ≥ 1 (kalau 0, ditulis pecahan biasa saja).\n2. Bagian pecahan `b/c` adalah pecahan **murni** (b < c).\n3. Penyebut c ≠ 0 dan c ≥ 2.\n\n**❌ Bukan campuran:** 3 5/4 (sebab 5/4 bukan pecahan murni), 0 2/3 (sebab a = 0)."},{"title":"B.1 Campuran → Biasa","content":"Rumus: **a b/c = (a × c + b) / c**\n\nLangkah cerita: \"Kalikan bagian bulat dengan penyebut, lalu tambah pembilang. Penyebut tetap.\"\n\nContoh:\n- 2¾ = (2 × 4 + 3)/4 = (8 + 3)/4 = **11/4**.\n- 3⅖ = (3 × 5 + 2)/5 = 17/5.\n- 5⅓ = (5 × 3 + 1)/3 = 16/3."},{"title":"B.2 Biasa → Campuran (pembilang ≥ penyebut)","content":"Langkah: **bagi pembilang dengan penyebut**.\n- Hasil bagi = bagian **bulat** `a`.\n- Sisa pembagian = **pembilang baru** `b`.\n- Penyebut **tetap** `c`.\n\nContoh:\n- 11/4: 11 : 4 = 2 sisa 3 → **2¾**.\n- 17/5: 17 : 5 = 3 sisa 2 → 3⅖.\n- 20/6: 20 : 6 = 3 sisa 2 → 3 2/6 = **3⅓** (sederhanakan).\n- 12/4 = 3 (jadi bilangan bulat utuh, bukan campuran)."},{"title":"C. Operasi Hitung Pecahan Campuran","content":"**Aturan emas:** Untuk operasi yang melibatkan campuran, **ubah dulu semuanya ke pecahan biasa**, hitung, lalu ubah balik ke campuran jika hasil pembilang ≥ penyebut."},{"title":"C.1 Penjumlahan & Pengurangan","content":"Contoh: 1½ + 2⅓ = 3/2 + 7/3 = 9/6 + 14/6 = 23/6 = **3⅚**.\nContoh: 4¼ − 1⅔ = 17/4 − 5/3 = 51/12 − 20/12 = 31/12 = **2 7/12**.\n\n**Cara cepat tanpa konversi (boleh, untuk +):** jumlahkan bagian bulat dan bagian pecahan terpisah → 1½ + 2⅓ = (1+2) + (½ + ⅓) = 3 + 5/6 = 3⅚. **Hati-hati** kalau bagian pecahan menghasilkan ≥ 1, harus dinaikkan ke bagian bulat. Pengurangan **harus pinjam** kalau pecahan atas < pecahan bawah → tetap lebih aman ubah ke biasa."},{"title":"C.2 Perkalian","content":"**Wajib** ubah ke biasa dulu. Jangan kalikan bulat × bulat lalu pecahan × pecahan terpisah — itu **salah**.\nContoh: 1½ × 2⅓ = 3/2 × 7/3 = 21/6 = 7/2 = **3½**.\n❌ Salah: 1½ × 2⅓ = (1×2) + (½×⅓) = 2 + 1/6 = 2 1/6."},{"title":"C.3 Pembagian","content":"Ubah ke biasa, lalu kalikan dengan kebalikan.\nContoh: 2¼ ÷ 1½ = 9/4 ÷ 3/2 = 9/4 × 2/3 = 18/12 = 3/2 = **1½**."},{"title":"D. Membandingkan Pecahan Campuran","content":"1. **Bandingkan bagian bulat lebih dulu.** Yang bagian bulatnya lebih besar pasti lebih besar nilainya. Contoh: 4⅛ > 3⅞ karena 4 > 3.\n2. Kalau bagian bulat **sama**, bandingkan bagian pecahan dengan menyamakan penyebut. Contoh: 2¾ vs 2⅗ → bandingkan ¾ vs ⅗ → 15/20 vs 12/20 → ¾ lebih besar."},{"title":"E. Soal Cerita Aplikatif","content":"- **Resep masakan:** 1½ kg tepung + ¾ kg tepung = 2¼ kg.\n- **Jarak tempuh:** Andi jalan 2⅓ km lalu lari 1⅔ km → total 4 km.\n- **Waktu:** 1 jam 15 menit + 2 jam 45 menit = 4 jam.\n- **Pembagian rata:** 5½ kue dibagi 11 anak → ½ kue per anak."},{"title":"F. Miskonsepsi yang Sering Dihukum di Soal","content":"1. **Salah konversi:** 2¾ disangka = 2 + 3 + 4 = 9 atau 2 × ¾ = 1½. Yang benar: 2 + ¾ = 11/4.\n2. **Salah perkalian:** 1½ × 2 dianggap (1×2)½ = 2½. Yang benar: 3/2 × 2 = 3.\n3. **Lupa pinjam saat kurang:** 3¼ − 1¾ dianggap 2 − 2/4 = 1½ (padahal harus 1½). Sering muncul kesalahan tanda.\n4. **Tidak menyederhanakan:** 11/4 ditulis 2¾ ✓, tapi sering muncul 2 6/8 yang tidak sederhana."},{"title":"G. Tips Cepat","content":"- Hafal kuadrat kecil: ½ = 0,5 · ¼ = 0,25 · ¾ = 0,75 · ⅓ ≈ 0,33 · ⅔ ≈ 0,67 · ⅕ = 0,2 · ⅖ = 0,4 · ⅗ = 0,6 · ⅘ = 0,8 · ⅛ = 0,125. Berguna untuk perkiraan.\n- Untuk konversi cepat: a b/c → tinggal hitung `a × c + b`, taruh di atas c.\n- Untuk perkalian cepat, kalau bisa dicoret silang, lakukan sebelum mengalikan.\n\n---"}],"questions":[{"number":1,"subTopic":"Latihan","level":"Kab","question":"Bentuk pecahan campuran dari 11/4 adalah …","options":{"A":"1¾","B":"2¾","C":"3¼","D":"4¼"},"answerKey":"B","concept":"","analysis":{"A":"","B":"","C":"","D":""},"steps":[],"tips":""},{"number":2,"subTopic":"Latihan","level":"Kab","question":"Bentuk pecahan biasa dari 2¾ adalah …","options":{"A":"11/4","B":"9/4","C":"5/4","D":"8/4"},"answerKey":"A","concept":"","analysis":{"A":"","B":"","C":"","D":""},"steps":[],"tips":""},{"number":3,"subTopic":"Latihan","level":"Kab","question":"Hasil dari 1½ + 2¼ adalah …","options":{"A":"3⅛","B":"3½","C":"3¾","D":"4"},"answerKey":"C","concept":"","analysis":{"A":"","B":"","C":"","D":""},"steps":[],"tips":""},{"number":4,"subTopic":"Latihan","level":"Kab","question":"Hasil dari 3⅖ − 1⅕ adalah …","options":{"A":"2⅖","B":"2⅕","C":"4⅗","D":"2 1/10"},"answerKey":"D","concept":"","analysis":{"A":"","B":"","C":"","D":""},"steps":[],"tips":""},{"number":5,"subTopic":"Latihan","level":"Kab","question":"Hasil 2⅓ × 1½ adalah …","options":{"A":"2½","B":"3⅙","C":"3½","D":"4"},"answerKey":"C","concept":"","analysis":{"A":"","B":"","C":"","D":""},"steps":[],"tips":""},{"number":6,"subTopic":"Latihan","level":"Kab","question":"Hasil 3 : 1½ adalah …","options":{"A":"4½","B":"1½","C":"2","D":"3"},"answerKey":"C","concept":"","analysis":{"A":"","B":"","C":"","D":""},"steps":[],"tips":""},{"number":7,"subTopic":"Latihan","level":"Kab","question":"Hasil 5⅓ + 2⅔ adalah …","options":{"A":"7","B":"7⅓","C":"8","D":"8⅔"},"answerKey":"C","concept":"","analysis":{"A":"","B":"","C":"","D":""},"steps":[],"tips":""},{"number":8,"subTopic":"Latihan","level":"Kab","question":"Hasil 6¼ − 2½ adalah …","options":{"A":"3¾","B":"4¼","C":"3¼","D":"4¾"},"answerKey":"A","concept":"","analysis":